From 87af82dda6384ca7d9989ea627d0422e6e350d7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 06:36:03 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] docs(site): macOS equivalents beside Windows-specific
 instructions

Shortcuts keep their Ctrl notation with a note on first-run that Cmd is
the key on macOS (the app binds them through egui's command modifier,
panes.rs). Pages that name a shortcut or a click get the macOS form
beside it. The install page names the binaries and release files inside
CamCraft.app and the macOS ZIP and DMG (scripts/package-macos.sh). The
gates page names both gate wrappers and says cargo xtask gate is the
same on every OS.

Fixes #1236

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
